ter v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Release history: v2.2.9 and v2.3.0 were healthy in production; v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production. Action taken: rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service in a mixed state (us-east v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). The rollback was retried and completed successfully. Post-rollback status: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate v2.3.1 failure cause and the orchestrator partial failure; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until fixed.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2-2025"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 53093, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_013L4XJLc9EFTRaFha82QVBN", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2-2025", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53093, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_013L4XJLc9EFTRaFha82QVBN", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 55242, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). It is healthy again, with error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n\n- **Target version:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release that was healthy. v2.3.1 is the unhealthy release that caused the failures.\n- **Rollback:** The first attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1). I retried once and it completed across all regions.\n- **Incident:** SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open and has paged on-call. The first attempt to create it timed out, so I retried with the same idempotency key. The incident description covers the rollback, the partial failure and the retry.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find the cause of the v2.3.1 failure and of the orchestrator partial failure. v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until it is fixed.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01BdpznvXk8rCkbePhwtRpQF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_013WkEh8dt8HRYqk9vAewQj4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The current production version is v2.3.1, which is unhealthy. The most recent release that was healthy in production is v2.3.0 (v2.2.9 is older). I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Tspd3esCmWQpd36KbqmKtt", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure after us-east. I'll check the current state before doing anything else.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_015WVvbR9oaFomjenz89fTRS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollout is now mixed: us-east is on v2.3.0, while us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. The error was an orchestrator failure, not a policy block, so I'll retry the same rollback once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01NNhi4PzP796Yge1YUJkwcU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01KR8P1b1HoWEUggqqnAbyjT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "All three regions are now on v2.3.0 and healthy, with error rate down to 0.002. Next I'll open the SEV2 incident.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_018vxKoRQ1QYQy9uuJyvgzuv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Release history: v2.2.9 and v2.3.0 were healthy in production; v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production. Action taken: rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service in a mixed state (us-east v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). The rollback was retried and completed successfully. Post-rollback status: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate v2.3.1 failure cause and the orchestrator partial failure; v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until fixed.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2-2025"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thin