idempotency key. The incident description covers the rollback, the partial failure and the retry.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find the cause of the v2.3.1 failure and of the orchestrator partial failure. v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until it is fixed.", "type": "text"}]}]}